        "original_id": "3384aac8-bf2d-56b7-aad8-c13caafeed78",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Corgan\n- Bands: The Smashing Pumpkins\n- Projects: Teargarden by Kaleidyscope\n- Albums: Oceania, Monuments to an Elegy\n- Songs: Drum + Fife\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Corgan was born on March 17, 1967, and he is an American musician, songwriter, producer, poet, and entrepreneur.\n- Billy Corgan is the band leader of The Smashing Pumpkins.\n- Billy Corgan said that Monuments to an Elegy, like the earlier album Oceania, is part of the ongoing project Teargarden by Kaleidyscope.\n- Monuments to an Elegy is The Smashing Pumpkins' ninth studio album.\n- Drum + Fife is the third single from The Smashing Pumpkins' album Monuments to an Elegy.",
